## Final Report

**Problem.** A 500×500 square is tiled by k axis-parallel rectangles with integer side lengths. No two rectangles have the same perimeter. K = max k; find K mod 105.

Since perimeter = 2(w+h), distinct perimeters ⇔ distinct semiperimeters s = w+h, and total area = 250000.

